### P0 — Build receipts do not prove the launched binary came from the captured build

`HermeticBuildTranscript` has no final binary path, size, or hash: [build.rs:282](/Users/mkbabb/Programming/bbnf-lang/xtask/src/architecture/assay/build.rs:282). The exporter is supplied separately by the launch request, and `LoadedLane` creates an identity by pairing that arbitrary exporter hash with the transcript: [launch.rs:891](/Users/mkbabb/Programming/bbnf-lang/xtask/src/architecture/assay/launch.rs:891).

